//
// MachineCSE can remove repeated fp8 staging inserts after an intervening
// tile overwrites staging. The int8/int4/bf16 inserts read crIntMMode and
// are unaffected. This reduced B0/B1/B0 case requires all six inserts.
//
// Run llc without aiecc's -disable-machine-cse workaround to expose the
// backend defect. aie4-mmac-fp8-cse-guard.mlir checks the driver's flags.
//
// REQUIRES: peano
// XFAIL: *
//
// RUN: llc -O2 --mtriple=aie4 --mcpu=aie4b %S/Inputs/aie4_fp8_restage_cse.ll -o %t.s
// RUN: grep -c "f_za\[" %t.s | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=REDUCED
// REDUCED: {{^}}6{{$}}
